# Copy to .env for local dev. In the Claude Code routine, set these as environment variables
# on the routine's cloud environment instead -- never commit real values.

SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL=

# Apify, GetLeads.io, Icypeas, Prospeo, PredictLeads, and lemlist are NOT set here -- all six
# are official hosted MCP connectors, authenticated once via claude.ai Settings > Connectors.
# Nothing to configure per-repo; just make sure each is checked under the routine's Connectors
# section (Evening routine needs: Apify, GetLeads.io, Icypeas, Prospeo, PredictLeads, lemlist.
# Morning routine needs: whichever delivery connector you use, e.g. Slack or Google Sheets, if
# those are added as connectors instead of a webhook).
